they would eventually fall to their knees.

Sensation unlike anything she had ever felt before poured in like a waterfall
from the rock-hard, erect penis,
forcing a cracking scream from the back of her throat.

However, she didn't need him to tell her that;
the shock of being punched out of nowhere had already
completely uprooted any desire she had to resist.

Yet by now, such things were nothing more than a trivial matter;
as a strangely giddy mood washed over Mizuna,
she began weeping and sobbing in inexplicable despair.

Not a single shred of desire to defy the men remained in her;
in fact, a part of her was even beginning to feel joy
at being ejaculated on.

The most agonizing part was being unable to breathe;
with both her nose and throat completely plugged,
